Package: cubecheck
Version: @VERSION@
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: @ARCH@
Maintainer: AuraStudio, AnProject
Depends: libc6
Recommends: plocate | mlocate, gnome-system-monitor | htop
Suggests: fsearch, catfish, sysdig
Description: CubeCheck — проверка ПК на читы Minecraft
 CubeCheck is a desktop checker for Minecraft cheat names.
 On Linux it launches FSearch/Catfish/plocate, Mission Center or
 GNOME System Monitor, sysdig, and in-app autostart/recent-file lists.
 Windows tools (Everything, Sysinternals) are not included.
